  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Paleooceanography of Effingham Inlet, 1999",
  "description": "NSERC-funded interdisciplinary study of ancient waters in Effingham Inlet.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Paleooceanography of the ancient waters retained in Effingham inlet. Studying the history of pelagic fish since the last ice age.\n\nSupplemental information: Risk Justification: Data are in electronic format, well backed up and well documented. Risk of Loss: Low Impact Justification: Data of a particularly unique or valuable nature Impact of Loss: High Recommended Action: None",
