  "measurementTechnique": "Logical consistency: CTD data processed using normal IOS processing procedures. Normal standardization of CTD instruments at IOS.\n\nCompleteness: Dataset Complications: The accuracy of the CTD data may vary depending on the instruments used and whether collaborating data were collected for intercomparison purposes. Guildline CTDs are standardized at IOS; Sea-Bird CTD`s are calibrated at Sea-Bird Electronics in Bellevue, Washington.\n\nProcessing step (1999): DFO, Carleton University, University of Victoria, University of British Columbia, NOAA, Pacific Geoscience Center (Nat. Resources)",
